{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Ginger Chicken",
  "text": "Ginger Chicken\n\nPreparation Time: 10 minutes\n\nCooking time: 15 minutes\n\nYield: 4 servings\n\nIngredients\n\n1 chicken cut into pieces\n\n1 large onion - finely diced\n\n1 good piece of fresh ginger - finely grated\n\n¼ cup dry sherry\n\n¼ cup soya sauce\n\n¼ cup water\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Heat pressure cooker (lid off) with some oil\n\n2. Brown pieces of chicken\n\n3. Sprinkle the chicken with the onion and ginger\n\n4. Mix well, then add sherry, soya sauce and water\n\n5. Close the lid, and when full pressure is reached reduce the heat and cook for 8 minutes (10psi) or about 6 minutes for higher pressure (15psi) cookers\n\n6. Add salt and pepper to taste",
  "prepTime": "PT10M",
  "cookTime": "PT15M",
  "recipeYield": "4 servings",
